data: {"id": "6e63e4f3996b4af0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1219", "run_id": "6e63e4f3996b4af0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具结果，对 `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` 的 CrashLoopBackOff 根因证据如下：\n\n### 1. 支持“配置缺失导致 CrashLoopBackOff\"的证据\n*   **Kubernetes 状态确认**：Pod 处于 `Running` 阶段但 `Ready=False`。`containerStatuses` 明确显示 container `app` 的 `reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`exitCode=78`，`restarts=12`。事件（Events）记录了过去 38 分钟内 155 次 `Warning BackOff`，证实了持续的重启循环。\n*   **应用日志一致指向 `CONFIG_MISSING`**：无论是当前日志（`kubectl_logs_all_containers`）还是上次崩溃前的日志（`kubectl_previous_logs_all_containers`），内容完全一致。日志显示 HTTP 请求失败，`level` 为 `error`，", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789074599551, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

